config TILT_SIM
  bool "Simulate tilt sensor readings"
  default y
  help
    Feeds synthetic X/Y/Z tilt values (slow drift plus periodic shake
    bursts) into device_status_set_tilt(), standing in for a real
    accelerometer driver so the Tilt screen can be exercised without
    hardware. Disable once a real tilt sensor driver is wired in.

config ENV_SIM
  bool "Simulate environment sensor readings"
  default y
  help
    Feeds a synthetic ppm reading (slow drift plus noise) and its
    matching simulated ADC voltage into device_status_set_environment(),
    standing in for a real environment sensor driver so the Environment
    screen can be exercised without hardware. Disable once a real
    environment sensor driver is wired in.
